  "questionText": "Which one of the following options is correct for the given data in the table?<br><br><table style=\"border: 1px solid white; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: center; margin: 0 auto;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 8px 12px;\">Iteration ($i$)</td>\n    <td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 8px 12px;\">0</td>\n    <td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 8px 12px;\">1</td>\n    <td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 8px 12px;\">2</td>\n    <td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 8px 12px;\">3</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 8px 12px;\">Input ($I$)</td>\n    <td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 8px 12px;\">20</td>\n    <td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 8px 12px;\">-4</td>\n    <td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 8px 12px;\">10</td>\n    <td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 8px 12px;\">15</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 8px 12px;\">Output ($X$)</td>\n    <td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 8px 12px;\">20</td>\n    <td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 8px 12px;\">16</td>\n    <td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 8px 12px;\">26</td>\n    <td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 8px 12px;\">41</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 8px 12px;\">Output ($Y$)</td>\n    <td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 8px 12px;\">20</td>\n    <td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 8px 12px;\">-80</td>\n    <td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 8px 12px;\">-800</td>\n    <td style=\"border: 1px solid white; padding: 8px 12px;\">-12000</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>",
